# GitHub Pages Deployment

- This is a Vite React app deployed as a GitHub Pages project site.
- Keep `base: '/cv/'` in `vite.config.js` for the `erionrexhepii/cv` repository.
- Do not change the GitHub Actions workflow branch from `main` unless the git default branch changes.
- Build output should remain `dist`.
- Use `npm ci` in GitHub Actions and `npm.cmd install` locally on Windows.
- Validate deployment changes with `npm.cmd run build`.
- Do not commit generated `dist` files unless the deployment strategy changes.
- Expected public URL: `https://erionrexhepii.github.io/cv/`.
